Ladybird sends no wheel event to a page for a step whose deltas are all
zero, as Gecko does in WidgetEvent::IsAllowedToDispatchDOMEvent(). And
WebKit runs only the default handling of such an event, stopping its
propagation in Element::dispatchWheelEvent(), whose comment says some
sites break otherwise. Blink dispatches neither the may-begin nor the
ended or canceled phase of a touchpad gesture to the page, in
MouseWheelEventManager::HandleWheelEvent().
